{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "cash-management-collection-0001",
    "name": "Cash Management API",
    "description": "Coleção de cenários para a solução Cash Management (Lançamentos + Consolidado).\n\n**Organização das pastas:**\n- **Smoke** — caminho crítico que a CI/CD gateia (`newman --folder \"Smoke\"`). Poucos cenários, robustos, com polling no saldo.\n- **Auth / Entries / Balance / Health** — catálogo completo de endpoints para exploração manual (NÃO entram no gate de deploy).\n\nUse o environment **Cash Management — Local**. As URLs e portas são placeholders — ajuste quando o docker-compose definir as portas reais.\n\nFluxo sugerido para explorar: Auth → Entries (crédito/débito) → Balance → cenários de idempotência e erros.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{write_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Smoke",
      "description": "Caminho crítico que a CI/CD gateia via `newman --folder \"Smoke\"`. Poucos cenários, robustos, com **polling** no saldo (consistência eventual).\n\n**Dois tokens (ARCHITECTURE §8.1 / §9.1):** o token de **escrita** vem do `/dev/token` do Entries (scope `entries:write`, audience do Entries) e é usado no `POST /entries`; o token de **leitura** vem do `/dev/token` do Balance (scope `balances:read`, audience do Balance) e é usado no `GET /balances/{date}`. Cada serviço valida o token assinado pela SUA própria chave — não há chave/token compartilhado.\n\nO endpoint `/dev/token` é um **GET** e devolve `{ access_token, token_type }`. As outras pastas são para exploração manual e NÃO entram no gate de deploy.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Obter token de escrita (Entries)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{entries_url}}/dev/token", "host": ["{{entries_url}}"], "path": ["dev", "token"] },
            "description": "Token de desenvolvimento do Entries com scope `entries:write` (assinado pela chave do Entries)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('access_token recebido', () => pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "if (json.access_token) pm.environment.set('write_token', json.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Registrar crédito",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{write_token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" },
              { "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
            ],
            "body": { "mode": "raw", "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"Credit\",\n  \"amount\": 123.45,\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-06-26T10:00:00Z\"\n}" },
            "url": { "raw": "{{entries_url}}/entries", "host": ["{{entries_url}}"], "path": ["entries"] },
            "description": "Registra um crédito usando o token de **escrita** do Entries."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "pm.environment.set('expectedCredit', 123.45);",
                  "pm.environment.set('smokeDate', '2026-06-26');",
                  "pm.environment.unset('pollAttempts');"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Obter token de leitura (Balance)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{balance_url}}/dev/token", "host": ["{{balance_url}}"], "path": ["dev", "token"] },
            "description": "Token de desenvolvimento do Balance com scope `balances:read` (assinado pela chave do Balance)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('access_token recebido', () => pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "if (json.access_token) pm.environment.set('read_token', json.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Consultar saldo (com polling)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{read_token}}", "type": "string" }] },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }],
            "url": { "raw": "{{balance_url}}/balances/{{smokeDate}}", "host": ["{{balance_url}}"], "path": ["balances", "{{smokeDate}}"] },
            "description": "Usa o token de **leitura** do Balance. Espera a projeção (consistência eventual): repete a chamada até o saldo refletir o crédito ou esgotar as tentativas. Use `newman --delay-request 1000` para espaçar os polls."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "const expected = Number(pm.environment.get('expectedCredit'));",
                  "let attempts = Number(pm.environment.get('pollAttempts') || 0);",
                  "const body = pm.response.code === 200 ? pm.response.json() : null;",
                  "// Resposta vem no envelope padrão (§4.4): o saldo está em `result`.",
                  "const result = body && body.result ? body.result : body;",
                  "const reflected = result && Number(result.totalCredits) >= expected;",
                  "if (!reflected && attempts < 10) {",
                  "  pm.environment.set('pollAttempts', attempts + 1);",
                  "  pm.execution.setNextRequest(pm.info.requestName);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  pm.environment.unset('pollAttempts');",
                  "  pm.test('saldo reflete o crédito após a projeção', () => pm.expect(reflected).to.be.true);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "5. Sem token (401)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{balance_url}}/balances/{{smokeDate}}", "host": ["{{balance_url}}"], "path": ["balances", "{{smokeDate}}"] }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 Unauthorized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "description": "Tokens de desenvolvimento (chave estática, §9.1). Cada serviço emite e valida o seu próprio token: o Entries dá `entries:write` (audience do Entries); o Balance dá `balances:read` (audience do Balance). O endpoint `/dev/token` é um **GET** e devolve `{ access_token, token_type }`.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Token de escrita (Entries)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entries_url}}/dev/token",
              "host": ["{{entries_url}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Emite um JWT de dev do Entries com scope `entries:write`. Em produção, o token vem do IdP real (ARCHITECTURE §8.1)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('access_token recebido', () => pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "if (json.access_token) { pm.environment.set('write_token', json.access_token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Token de leitura (Balance)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{balance_url}}/dev/token",
              "host": ["{{balance_url}}"],
              "path": ["dev", "token"]
            },
            "description": "Emite um JWT de dev do Balance com scope `balances:read`. Em produção, o token vem do IdP real (ARCHITECTURE §8.1)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('access_token recebido', () => pm.expect(json.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "if (json.access_token) { pm.environment.set('read_token', json.access_token); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Entries (Lançamentos)",
      "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{write_token}}", "type": "string" }] },
      "description": "Usa o token de **escrita** do Entries (`write_token`) — rode \"Auth → Token de escrita (Entries)\" antes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Registrar crédito",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" },
              { "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"Credit\",\n  \"amount\": 150.75,\n  \"description\": \"Venda no balcao\",\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-06-25T13:00:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entries_url}}/entries",
              "host": ["{{entries_url}}"],
              "path": ["entries"]
            },
            "description": "Registra um crédito. Moeda é BRL (premissa de moeda única). Headers Idempotency-Key e X-Correlation-Id são gerados a cada chamada."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const result = json.result ? json.result : json;",
                  "pm.test('retorna id do lancamento', () => pm.expect(result.id).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "if (result.id) { pm.environment.set('entryId', result.id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Registrar débito",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" },
              { "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"Debit\",\n  \"amount\": 40.00,\n  \"description\": \"Compra de insumos\",\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-06-25T15:30:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entries_url}}/entries",
              "host": ["{{entries_url}}"],
              "path": ["entries"]
            }
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const result = pm.response.json().result || pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('retorna id do lancamento', () => pm.expect(result.id).to.be.a('string'));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Estornar lançamento",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"reason\": \"Lancamento duplicado\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entries_url}}/entries/{{entryId}}/reversal",
              "host": ["{{entries_url}}"],
              "path": ["entries", "{{entryId}}", "reversal"]
            },
            "description": "Estorna (compensa) o lançamento criado anteriormente. Usa o entryId salvo no environment."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('estorno aceito (200/201)', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Idempotência — 1ª gravação",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{idempotencyKey}}" },
              { "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"Credit\",\n  \"amount\": 99.90,\n  \"description\": \"Teste de idempotencia\",\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-06-25T16:00:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entries_url}}/entries",
              "host": ["{{entries_url}}"],
              "path": ["entries"]
            },
            "description": "Primeira chamada com uma Idempotency-Key fixa (gerada no pre-request)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "prerequest",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.environment.set('idempotencyKey', pm.variables.replaceIn('{{$guid}}'));"
                ]
              }
            },
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('201 Created', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "const result = pm.response.json().result || pm.response.json();",
                  "if (result.id) { pm.environment.set('idempotentEntryId', result.id); }"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Idempotência — retry (mesma chave)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{idempotencyKey}}" },
              { "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"Credit\",\n  \"amount\": 99.90,\n  \"description\": \"Teste de idempotencia\",\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-06-25T16:00:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entries_url}}/entries",
              "host": ["{{entries_url}}"],
              "path": ["entries"]
            },
            "description": "Reenvia a MESMA Idempotency-Key. Deve retornar o mesmo lançamento, sem criar um novo (dedup de escrita — ARCHITECTURE §4.3)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('não cria novo lancamento (mesmo id)', () => {",
                  "  const result = pm.response.json().result || pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.expect(result.id).to.eql(pm.environment.get('idempotentEntryId'));",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Sem token → 401",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"type\": \"Credit\",\n  \"amount\": 10.00,\n  \"occurredAt\": \"2026-06-25T16:10:00Z\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{entries_url}}/entries",
              "host": ["{{entries_url}}"],
              "path": ["entries"]
            },
            "description": "Cenário negativo: requisição sem JWT deve ser rejeitada com 401."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('401 Unauthorized', () => pm.response.to.have.status(401));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Balance (Consolidado)",
      "auth": { "type": "bearer", "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{read_token}}", "type": "string" }] },
      "description": "Usa o token de **leitura** do Balance (`read_token`) — rode \"Auth → Token de leitura (Balance)\" antes.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Consultar saldo do dia",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [{ "key": "X-Correlation-Id", "value": "{{$guid}}" }],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{balance_url}}/balances/{{date}}",
              "host": ["{{balance_url}}"],
              "path": ["balances", "{{date}}"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna o saldo consolidado da data (formato YYYY-MM-DD), lido direto da projeção em MongoDB."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 OK', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "const result = json.result ? json.result : json;",
                  "pm.test('contém os campos do saldo', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(result).to.have.property('date');",
                  "  pm.expect(result).to.have.property('totalCredits');",
                  "  pm.expect(result).to.have.property('totalDebits');",
                  "  pm.expect(result).to.have.property('balance');",
                  "});"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
